{
  "id": "MRK.5",
  "number": "5",
  "bookId": "MRK",
  "reference": "Mariko 5",
  "verseCount": 43,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "5",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "MRK 5"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "5",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 5:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yesu n'abegesibwabe bagoba buseli bunu bw'enyanja, omu nsi y'Abanyagerasi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.5.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.5.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 5:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kayamazire kuruga omu bwato, omushaija aruga omu nziiko akwetwe eiSitani aija amutahiremu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.5.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.5.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 5:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wenene ogwo yaturaga omu nyanga, bakaba batakimuboha, nangu n'omunyororo gwonkai kugumutaho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.5.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.5.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 5:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bamukomaga n'empingo n'eminyororo kyonkai eminyororo agigutura, n'empingo azihendahenda ebigutuka. Taliho muntu yakushoboire kumwelenga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.5.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.5.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 5:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kiro na mushana yaikaraga nakunga omu nyanga n'omu mabanga, nayekaratuza amabare. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.5.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.5.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 5:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kayamazire kubonera Yesu harai, agenda airukire amufukamira. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.5.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.5.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 5:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akunga n'eiraka lihango, ati, “Nonyenzaki iwe Yesu Mwana wa Rukirabyona? Nakutaho Ruhanga otanshasa.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.5.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.5.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 5:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Okugamba atyo Yesu akaba amugambiire ati, “Iwe Sitani omuntu ogu omurugemu!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.5.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.5.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 5:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yesu abaza Sitani ati, “Eibara wab'ohai?” Ahorora ati, “Eibara lyange ndi Ihe; aha rw'okuba tuli bangi.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.5.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.5.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 5:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amutagiliza muno Amasitani ago atagabinga mu nsi egyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.5.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.5.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 5:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho hakaba haliho obuhyo bungi bw'empunu nizilya omw'ibanga; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.5.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.5.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 5:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "gamutagiliza gati, “Otutaishure tugye omu mpunu.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.5.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.5.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 5:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba nikwo agajubura, omushaija gamurugamu, gataha omu mpunu, zikaba nizelenga kugoba omu 2,000. Zihilingita aha bulengo, zigwa omu nyanja zitontobera.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.5.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.5.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 5:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.5.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.5.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 5:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abashumba bairuka, ebyo babona eba baruro omu kigo n'omu byaro. Abantu baija kwelebera ekyabaho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.5.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.5.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 5:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bakwata muhanda baija ahali Yesu, babona ayabaire akwetwe Amasitani ali aho ashuntamire, ajwete mara aina amagezige gona, omuntu ayabaire aina eihe ly'Amasitani, batina. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.5.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.5.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 5:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ababaire baboine eky'omurwaire w'Amasitani n'ebyaba aha mpunu babarura. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.5.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.5.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 5:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abantu babanza kutagiliza Yesu k'abarugira omu nsi yabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.5.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.5.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 5:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kayabaire nataha omu bwato omushaija ayabaire akwetwe Amasitani amushaba kugenda nawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.5.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.5.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 5:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yesu ayanga, amugambira ati, “Oshube owanyu obone bataahi bawe, obagambiire byona eby'Omukama yakukolera, n'okwo yakuganyira.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.5.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.5.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 5:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omushaija akwata omuhanda agaruka omu nsi y'ebigo 10 ebyayetwaga Dekapoli, agamba ebyo Yesu yamukolera; abantu bona batangara.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.5.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.5.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 5:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.5.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.5.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 5:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Orwo Yesu yagarukire buseli akashabuka n'obwato, embaga emuhurulira nyingi, aho wenene ali haihi n'enyanja. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.5.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.5.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 5:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aijwa omukuru omoi w'esinagogi eibaralye Yairo. Kayamazire kubona Yesu amugwa omu maguru, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.5.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.5.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 5:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "amutagiliza ati, “Kahara kange kali haihi kufa. Singa oije okateho omukono kakire, karore.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.5.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.5.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 5:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yesu agenda na Yairo. Abantu bangi bamuhondera, nibamufunza oku n'oku omu muhanda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.5.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.5.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 5:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.5.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.5.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 5:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hakaba haliyo omukazi arwaire ekiganga emyaka 12, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.5.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.5.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 5:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "yagiire aha batambi batali bake, empiha zamuhoire aha mukono, aburwa kwikya, anenwa kushagaho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.5.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.5.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 5:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akaba yahuliize Yesu, aho aruga enyuma amuhondeire akwata aha kijwarokye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.5.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.5.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 5:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akaba nagira ati, “N'orwo ndakwata aha bijwarobye kushai ndakira.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.5.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.5.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 5:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho n'aho ekiganga kilekera, ayehulira n'omu rugingo okwo yakira oburwaire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.5.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.5.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 5:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yesu kuhulira okwo amani gamurugamu, akubuka bwangu amaisho aganaga omu mbaga, abaza ati, “Ayakwata aha bijwaro byange n'ohai?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.5.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.5.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 5:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abegesibwabe bamugambira bati, “Nobona okwo embaga ekutangatangire embaju zona, noshuba nobaza oti, ‘Ayankwataho n'ohai?’ ” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.5.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.5.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 5:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wenene aleba oku n'oku nahiga ayamukwataho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.5.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.5.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 5:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nawe omukazi akashangwa namanya ebyamubaho, aija natina, nachundwa, amugwa omu maisho amugambira amazima gona. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.5.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.5.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 5:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yesu amugambira ati, “Mwana wange, okwesiga kwawe kwakukiza; ogende n'emilembe mara okire oburwaire.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.5.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.5.34"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 5:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.5.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.5.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 5:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kayabaire akyagamba haliho abarugire omw'omukuru w'esinagogi, bagamba bati, “Muhara wawe yafire. Omwegesa otamwita kubi; lekera.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.5.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.5.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 5:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ebyo bagamba Yesu tabitaho mutima, agambira omukuru w'esinagogi ati, “Otatina, iwe ekikuru oyesige.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.5.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.5.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 5:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atanga ab'okumuhondera, shana Petero na Yakobo n'omurumuna Yohana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.5.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.5.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 5:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Orwo baagobire omw'omukuru w'esinagogi, ashanga abantu nibachura eyobobo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.5.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.5.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 5:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kayamazire kutaha omu nju ababaza ati, “Kiki nka muliyo nimuchura eyobobo? Omwana tafire anagiire.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.5.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.5.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 5:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bamushekelera. Abaturukya aheru. Akwata Yairo na mukaziwe n'abo yabaire ainabo, ataha omu kiyumba eky'omwana yabaire halimu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.5.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.5.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 5:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akwata omwana omukono, amugambira ati, “Talita kumi;” nikwo kugir'oti, “Kaisiki ninkugambira imuka.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.5.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.5.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 5:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Niho honkai omwisiki aimuka atambuka (akaba aina emyaka ikumi n'ebili), bagwa omu kitangaro. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.5.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.5.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 5:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abatanga muno ekigambo eki kukigambira abantu, ashuba abagambira kumuha ak'okulya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.5.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.5.43"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
